Z||000001||1FST2M6||01-19-2001||08:48 AM||||just inside the front 1/4 ground effects piece is a small 1/2" tab you have to press this tab down and pull straight out. and just behind the door/infront of the wheel there is the same thing.. did you take the rivits out of the interior also? the door sill those black bars pop off and there are 4 rivets under there also.. then it just comes right off..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
